    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3139" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκηδ-ία</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ιη,</span>
		ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀκήδεια</span>
			: <i>indifference, torpor, apathy</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Gland.</u>
				12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Cic.
				<u>Att.</u>
				12.45
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>weariness, exhaustion</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Herm.</u>
				77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				73
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεύματος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Is.</u>
					61.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> c. gen.,
				<i>neglect, disregard</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς παραφορῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>CA</u>
					1.1
				</span></i>
			.</div>
